// ============================================================
// COURSES PAGE — SA undergraduate programmes
//
// Programme "aps" numbers in the data are stored on the COMMON
// standard APS scale (best 6 academic subjects, LO excluded, max 42).
// At runtime, scoreForUniversity() computes each university's OWN
// prospectus score, and convertStandardApsToUniScale() maps the
// stored minimum onto that scale for a fair comparison:
//
//   • UP, UJ, Rhodes, UFS, most UoTs, UNISA … standard APS (max 42)
//   • UKZN, NWU ………………………………… 1–8 scale (max 48)
//   • UCT, NMU ………………………………… FPS / Applicant Score (max 600)
//   • Stellenbosch …………………………… TPT percentage average
//   • Wits ……………………………………… best 7 incl LO + Eng/Maths bonus
//   • UWC ……………………………………… best 7 including LO
//
// Meeting a minimum does NOT guarantee admission. Competitive
// programmes often admit well above the published floor.
// Always verify the official university prospectus for your intake year.
// ============================================================

